  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the demon hunter can reform any infernal with a Challenge Rating of less than half the demon hunter’s class level. By taking a full round action and uttering a profoundly important universal truth to a single infernal creature, the demon hunter brings the infernal creature to a heavenly state of consciousness. For a number of rounds equal to the demon hunter’s Charisma bonus (if any), the infernal gains the Celestial template. Its appearance becomes more beautiful and metallic. The infernal creature acts immediately in accordance with its new subtype and template.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/demon-hunter#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
